er value"},"6136":{"id":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks-228","page_id":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks#verification-algorithm","content":"Compute HMAC-SHA256 of the raw request body using your webhook `secret` as the key"},"6137":{"id":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks-229","page_id":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks#verification-algorithm","content":"Compare the computed signature with the header value using a timing-safe comparison"},"6138":{"id":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks-230","page_id":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks#retry-policy","content":"If your endpoint does not respond with a `2xx` status code within 10 seconds, NorthRelay retries the delivery:"},"6139":{"id":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks-231","page_id":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks#retry-policy","content":"Attempt"},"6140":{"id":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks-232","page_id":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks#retry-policy","content":"Delay"},"6141":{"id":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks-233","page_id":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks#retry-policy","content":"1st retry"},"6142":{"id":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks-234","page_id":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks#retry-policy","content":"30 seconds"},"6143":{"id":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks-235","page_id":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks#retry-policy","content":"2nd retry"},"6144":{"id":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks-236","page_id":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks#retry-policy","content":"2 minutes"},"6145":{"id":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks-237","page_id":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks#retry-policy","content":"3rd retry"},"6146":{"id":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks-238","page_id":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks#retry-policy","content":"15 minutes"},"6147":{"id":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks-239","page_id":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks#retry-policy","content":"4th retry"},"6148":{"id":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks-240","page_id":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks#retry-policy","content":"1 hour"},"6149":{"id":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks-241","page_id":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks#retry-policy","content":"5th retry"},"6150":{"id":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks-242","page_id":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks#retry-policy","content":"4 hours"},"6151":{"id":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks-243","page_id":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks#retry-policy","content":"After 5 failed retries, the event is marked as failed. Failed events are visible in **Dashboard > Webhooks > Event Log** for 30 days."},"6152":{"id":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks-244","page_id":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks#best-practices","content":"**Respond quickly.** Return `200` immediately and process the event asynchronously. Do not perform heavy work in the request handler."},"6153":{"id":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks-245","page_id":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks#best-practices","content":"**Handle duplicates.** Deduplicate on `eventType`, `messageId` and `recipient`. The same event may be delivered more than once, and a contact change can arrive before or after a related `list.*` event; read the current state with `GET /subscriptions/{email}` when order matters."},"6154":{"id":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks-246","page_id":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks#best-practices","content":"**Verify signatures.** Always validate the `X-NorthRelay-Signature` header."},"6155":{"id":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks-247","page_id":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks#best-practices","content":"**Use HTTPS.** Webhook URLs must use HTTPS. HTTP endpoints are rejected."},"6156":{"id":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks-248","page_id":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks#best-practices","content":"**Log failures.** Monitor your webhook endpoint health in the dashboard."},"6157":{"id":"/docs/billing/faq","page_id":"/docs/billing/faq","type":"page","content":"Billing FAQ","breadcrumbs":["NorthRelay Documentation","Billing"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/billing/faq"},"6158":{"id":"/docs/billing/faq-0","page_id":"/docs/billing/faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/billing/faq","content":"Frequently asked questions about NorthRelay billing, plan changes, and payments"},"6159":{"id":"/docs/billing/faq-1","page_id":"/docs/billing/faq","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/billing/faq#billing-faq","content":"Billing FAQ"},"6160":{"id":"/docs/billing/faq-2","page_id":"/docs/billing/faq","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/billing/faq#plan-changes","content":"Plan Changes"},"6161":{"id":"/docs/billing/faq-3","page_id":"/docs/billing/faq","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/billing/faq#can-i-switch-plans-at-any-time","content":"Can I switch plans at any time?"},"6162":{"id":"/docs/billing/faq-4","page_id":"/docs/billing/faq","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/billing/faq#is-my-billing-prorated-when-i-upgrade","content":"Is my billing prorated when I upg