reputation-monitoring#auto-resolution","content":"Incidents automatically resolve when the triggering metric returns below its warning threshold. You do not need to manually close incidents. The resolution is noted in the incident history with a timestamp."},"6998":{"id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring-116","page_id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring#if-your-bounce-rate-is-high","content":"**Clean your contact list.** Remove addresses that have hard-bounced. NorthRelay automatically adds hard bounces to your suppression list."},"6999":{"id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring-117","page_id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring#if-your-bounce-rate-is-high","content":"**Use double opt-in.** Require email confirmation before adding contacts to your list."},"7000":{"id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring-118","page_id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring#if-your-bounce-rate-is-high","content":"**Validate emails at collection.** Use email syntax validation on signup forms."},"7001":{"id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring-119","page_id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring#if-your-bounce-rate-is-high","content":"**Remove inactive subscribers.** Contacts who have not engaged in 6+ months are more likely to become invalid."},"7002":{"id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring-120","page_id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring#if-your-spam-complaint-rate-is-high","content":"**Only send to opted-in recipients.** Never purchase email lists."},"7003":{"id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring-121","page_id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring#if-your-spam-complaint-rate-is-high","content":"**Include a visible unsubscribe link.** Make it easy to opt out -- this reduces complaints."},"7004":{"id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring-122","page_id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring#if-your-spam-complaint-rate-is-high","content":"**Set expectations at signup.** Tell subscribers what content they will receive and how often."},"7005":{"id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring-123","page_id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring#if-your-spam-complaint-rate-is-high","content":"**Honor unsubscribes immediately.** Process opt-outs within the same sending cycle."},"7006":{"id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring-124","page_id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring#if-your-spam-complaint-rate-is-high","content":"**Segment your audience.** Send relevant content to each group rather than blasting everyone."},"7007":{"id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring-125","page_id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring#if-your-delivery-failure-rate-is-high","content":"**Check your DNS configuration.** Use the Pre-Flight Check to validate SPF, DKIM, and DMARC records."},"7008":{"id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring-126","page_id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring#if-your-delivery-failure-rate-is-high","content":"**Verify your sending domain.** Unverified domains have lower trust with receivers."},"7009":{"id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring-127","page_id":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/reputation-monitoring#if-your-delivery-failure-rate-is-high","content":"**Check the Blocklist Monitor.** Your IP or domain may be li