nd delivers it to the recipient's mail server. There is nothing to choose and nothing to configure — the path is the same for every account."},"7146":{"id":"/docs/features/two-pool-system-18","page_id":"/docs/features/two-pool-system","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/two-pool-system#how-we-protect-its-reputation","content":"A single IP only works if it stays clean. These protections are enforced in code on every message:"},"7147":{"id":"/docs/features/two-pool-system-19","page_id":"/docs/features/two-pool-system","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/two-pool-system#how-we-protect-its-reputation","content":"**Verified-From policy** — you can only send from a domain you have added and verified in your dashboard (or a subdomain of one). Requests from any other address are rejected with `403 FORBIDDEN_SENDER` and a message telling you which domain to verify. Nobody can spoof a domain they don't own."},"7148":{"id":"/docs/features/two-pool-system-20","page_id":"/docs/features/two-pool-system","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/two-pool-system#how-we-protect-its-reputation","content":"**One-click unsubscribe** — every marketing and campaign message carries RFC 8058 `List-Unsubscribe` headers, so recipients can opt out with one click instead of reporting spam."},"7149":{"id":"/docs/features/two-pool-system-21","page_id":"/docs/features/two-pool-system","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/two-pool-system#how-we-protect-its-reputation","content":"**Bounce and complaint suppression** — hard bounces and spam complaints are added to your suppression list automatically and never mailed again."},"7150":{"id":"/docs/features/two-pool-system-22","page_id":"/docs/features/two-pool-system","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/two-pool-system#how-we-protect-its-reputation","content":"**Hourly delivery canary** — every hour NorthRelay sends a real message through the full sending path to a monitored mailbox and checks that it arrives with SPF, DKIM and DMARC passing. If it fails or goes stale, our team is alerted."},"7151":{"id":"/docs/features/two-pool-system-23","page_id":"/docs/features/two-pool-system","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/two-pool-system#how-we-protect-its-reputation","content":"**Full authentication alignment** — the relay signs with DKIM for your verified domain, `include:_spf.north-pipe.ca` covers SPF for IPv4 and IPv6, and both align with DMARC. See DNS Setup."},"7152":{"id":"/docs/features/two-pool-system-24","page_id":"/docs/features/two-pool-system","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/two-pool-system#what-changes-between-tiers","content":"Plans differ in limits and features, not in where your mail comes from:"},"7153":{"id":"/docs/features/two-pool-system-25","page_id":"/docs/features/two-pool-system","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/two-pool-system#what-changes-between-tiers","content":"Tier"},"7154":{"id":"/docs/features/two-pool-system-26","page_id":"/docs/features/two-pool-system","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/two-pool-system#what-changes-between-tiers","content":"Price (CAD/mo)"},"7155":{"id":"/docs/features/two-pool-system-27","page_id":"/docs/features/two-pool-system","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/two-pool-system#what-changes-between-tiers","content":"Emails/Month"},"7156":{"id":"/docs/features/two-pool-system-28","page_id":"/docs/features/two-pool-system","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/two-pool-system#what-changes-between-tiers","content":"Custom domains"},"7157":{"id":"/docs/features/two-pool-system-29","page_id":"/docs/features/two-pool-system","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/two-pool-system#what-changes-between-tiers","content":"Inbox cap"},"7158":{"id":"/docs/features/two-pool-system-30","page_id":"/docs/features/two-pool-system","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/two-pool-system#what-changes-between-tiers","content":"Inbox retention"},"7159":{"id":"/doc