},"7664":{"id":"/docs/guides/mailing-lists-16","page_id":"/docs/guides/mailing-lists","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guides/mailing-lists#mailing-lists-and-newsletters","content":"This guide shows how to build mailing-list features into your own product with NorthRelay: a newsletter signup, double opt-in, a preference page inside your app, unsubscribe links, and keeping your database in sync. NorthRelay holds the audience and enforces the opt-out rules; your app calls the API and listens to webhooks."},"7665":{"id":"/docs/guides/mailing-lists-17","page_id":"/docs/guides/mailing-lists","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guides/mailing-lists#mailing-lists-and-newsletters","content":"You need an API key with `contacts:read` and `contacts:write` (and `suppressions:write` if you create topics through the API). Campaigns are available on Micro and above; lists, contacts and the Subscriptions API work on every plan. On Free, subscriptions and signup forms can activate up to 100 contacts."},"7666":{"id":"/docs/guides/mailing-lists-18","page_id":"/docs/guides/mailing-lists","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guides/mailing-lists#the-building-blocks","content":"Concept"},"7667":{"id":"/docs/guides/mailing-lists-19","page_id":"/docs/guides/mailing-lists","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guides/mailing-lists#the-building-blocks","content":"What it means"},"7668":{"id":"/docs/guides/mailing-lists-20","page_id":"/docs/guides/mailing-lists","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guides/mailing-lists#the-building-blocks","content":"API"},"7669":{"id":"/docs/guides/mailing-lists-21","page_id":"/docs/guides/mailing-lists","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guides/mailing-lists#the-building-blocks","content":"**Contact**"},"7670":{"id":"/docs/guides/mailing-lists-22","page_id":"/docs/guides/mailing-lists","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guides/mailing-lists#the-building-blocks","content":"One recipient address in your account, with status (`PENDING`, `ACTIVE`, `UNSUBSCRIBED`, `BOUNCED`, `COMPLAINED`, `CLEANED`) and consent evidence"},"7671":{"id":"/docs/guides/mailing-lists-23","page_id":"/docs/guides/mailing-lists","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guides/mailing-lists#the-building-blocks","content":"Contacts"},"7672":{"id":"/docs/guides/mailing-lists-24","page_id":"/docs/guides/mailing-lists","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guides/mailing-lists#the-building-blocks","content":"**List**"},"7673":{"id":"/docs/guides/mailing-lists-25","page_id":"/docs/guides/mailing-lists","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guides/mailing-lists#the-building-blocks","content":"An audience you send campaigns to, such as \"Monthly newsletter\""},"7674":{"id":"/docs/guides/mailing-lists-26","page_id":"/docs/guides/mailing-lists","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guides/mailing-lists#the-building-blocks","content":"Contact lists"},"7675":{"id":"/docs/guides/mailing-lists-27","page_id":"/docs/guides/mailing-lists","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guides/mailing-lists#the-building-blocks","content":"**Topic**"},"7676":{"id":"/docs/guides/mailing-lists-28","page_id":"/docs/guides/mailing-lists","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guides/mailing-lists#the-building-blocks","content":"A kind of mail people can opt out of on its own, such as \"Product updates\" or \"Events\". Stored as a suppression group whose members are the people who **opted out**."},"7677":{"id":"/docs/guides/mailing-lists-29","page_id":"/docs/guides/mailing-lists","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guides/mailing-lists#the-building-blocks","content":"Topics"},"7678":{"id":"/docs/guides/mailing-lists-30","page_id":"/docs/guides/mailing-lists","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guides/mailing-lists#the-building-blocks","content":"**Global unsubscribe**"},"7679":{"id":"/docs/guides/mailing-lists-31","page_id":"/docs/guides/mailing-lists","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guides/mailing-lists#the-building-blocks","content":"\"Stop all marketing mail.\" Contact becomes `UNSUBSCRIBED` and an account-level `Unsubscribe` suppression is added."},"7680":{"id":"/docs/guides/mailing-lists-32","page_id":"/docs/guides/mailing-lists","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guides/mailing-lists#the-building-blocks","content":"Subscriptions"},"7681":{"id":"/docs/guides/mailing-lists-33","page_id":"/docs/guides/mailing-lists","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guides/mailing-lists#the-building-blocks","content":"**Lists or topics?** Use a list for \"who do I send this to\" and a topic for \"what kind of mail is this\". A common setup is one topic per kind of mail, and each list tagged with its topic. Then:"},"7682":{"id":"/docs/guides/mailing-lists-34","page_id":"/docs/guides/mailing-lists","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guides/mailing-lists#the-building-blocks","content":"opting out of the topic removes the person from every list tagged with it, and"},"7683":{"id":"/docs/guides/mailing-lists-35","page_id":"/docs/guides/mailing-lists","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guides/mailing-lists#the-building-blocks","content":"any marketing send under that topic (a campaign to a tagged list, a campaign with that subscription topic, or a marketing-stream API send with `suppressionGroupId`) skips people who opted out, whichever list they are on."},"7684":{"id":"/docs/guides/mailing-lists-36","page_id":"/docs/guides/mailing-lists","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guides/mailing-lists#the-building-blocks","content":"Campaigns go only to current members of the list: someone who unsubscribed from the list (`scope: \"list\"`) or has not yet confirmed a double opt-in (`PENDING`) is not sent the campaign. Tag your lists with topics as well, so that one opt-out covers every list and every send of that kind of mail."},"7685":{"id":"/docs/guides/mailing-lists-37","page_id":"/docs/guides/mailing-lists","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guides/mailing-lists#1-set-up-a-topic-and-a-list","content":"Create the topic, give it the wording recipients will see, and create a list tagged with it."},"7686":{"id":"/docs/guides/mailing-lists-38","page_id":"/docs/guides/mailing-lists","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guides/mailing-lists#1-set-up-a-topic-and-a-list","content":"You can do the same in the dashboard under Contacts."},"7687":{"id":"/docs/guides/mailing-lists-39","page_id":"/docs/guides/mailing-lists","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guides/mailing-lists#2-collect-signups","content":"There are two ways to get people onto a list."},"7688":{"id":"/docs/guides/mailing-lists-40","page_id":"/docs/guides/mailing-lists","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guides/mailing-lists#2-collect-signups","content":"Hosted signup form"},"7689":{"id":"/docs/guides/mailing-lists-41","page_id":"/docs/guides/mailing-lists","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guides/mailing-lists#2-collect-signups","content":"Subscriptions API"},"7690":{"id":"/docs/guides/mailing-lists-42","page_id":"/docs/guides/mailing-lists","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guides/mailing-lists#2-collect-signups","content":"Where it runs"},"7691":{"id":"/docs/guides/mailing-lists-43","page_id":"/docs/guides/mailing-lists","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guides/mailing-lists#2-collect-signups","content":"Browser posts straight to NorthRelay (`POST /api/v1/forms/{id}/submit`, public, CORS)"},"7692":{"id":"/docs/guides/mailing-lists-44","page_id":"/docs/guides/mailing-lists","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guides/mailing-lists#2-collect-signups","content":"Your server calls `POST /api/v1/subscriptions` with your API key"},"7693":{"id":"/docs/guides/mailing-lists-45","page_id":"/docs/guides/mailing-lists","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guides/mailing-lists#2-collect-signups","content":"Best for"},"7694":{"id":"/docs/guides/mailing-lists-46","page_id":"/docs/guides/mailing-lists","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guides/mailing-lists#2-collect-signups","content":"Marketing sites, landing pages, no backend"},"7695":{"id":"/docs/guid